OL,3,GNEWSA'Lump on head was cancer eating
OL,4,Ahole in my skull'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Medway is raising
OL,7,Fawareness after a golf ball-sized lump
OL,8,Fon her forehead turned out to be an
OL,9,Fincurable blood cancer which had eaten
OL,10,Fa hole in her skull.
OL,12,FKatrina Fox had joked with her friends
OL,13,Fabout her growth at first, even
OL,14,Fnicknaming it Bert, while her GP
OL,15,Finitially diagnosed it as a harmless
OL,16,Fcyst.
OL,18,FBut when the 38-year-old from Rochester
OL,19,Ftried to have it removed she was told
OL,20,Fby medics that they had found a tumour,
OL,21,Falong with 3cm gap in her cranium
OL,22,Fthrough which they could see her brain.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
